g1: $ uadm x0 , w ∊ lvals , v ∊ sat x0 M (enc_ctx G2) w , x1 ∊ fseq x0 ∧ cdm x1 = fv nvf (enc_nat n) ∧ x2 ∊ sat x0 M (enc_ctx G) w ∧ v = scat x1 x2 ⇒ dt x0 M (enc_expr r) w (scat x1 x2) = dt x0 M (enc_expr e2) w x2 $ by eq_trans [e1, m1]
